
Simple and Delicious Curry Recipe
Ingredients:

1 onion, chopped
2 garlic cloves, minced
Olive oil
1 block tofu, cubed
1 cup mushrooms, sliced
1 tbsp curry powder
1 tbsp curry paste
1 tbsp peanut butter
1 tsp Korean pepper paste (adjust for spice level)
1 cup coconut cream
Cooked rice, for serving
Instructions:

1. Heat a drizzle of olive oil in a pot over medium heat. Add the chopped onion and minced garlic, and sauté until softened and fragrant.
2. Add the cubed tofu and sliced mushrooms to the pot. Stir and cook for a few minutes until they start to brown slightly.
3. Stir in the curry powder, curry paste, peanut butter, and Korean pepper paste. Mix well to coat all the ingredients evenly.
4. Pour in the coconut cream and stir to combine. Lower the heat and let the curry simmer for 10-15 minutes, allowing the flavors to meld together.
5. While the curry simmers, cook your rice according to package instructions.
6. Serve the curry hot over a bed of rice and enjoy!
